      "text": "A 36-year old cyclist was fatally struck by a sports utility vehicle (SUV) in Pasig City after he tried to avoid a delivery van that was parked along the bicycle lane.\n\nPrior to the accident, the victim overtook another cyclist as he seemed to avoid the parked van. As he was doing so the van’s rear door suddenly opened, hitting the victim.\n\nRead more:\nhttps://t.co/XDXblRZv9B",
